---
/* Home "Beyond the canvas" section, carried over from the legacy page. */
---
<section id="lead" data-section="" data-bg="beam" aria-labelledby="lead-title" style="background: var(--surface-card); border-block: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding-block: var(--section-y);">
    <div class="cory-container" style="display: grid; gap: var(--space-10);">
      <div data-reveal="" style="display: grid; gap: var(--space-3);">
        <p class="cory-overline" style="margin: 0px;"><span class="sc-interp">Beyond the canvas</span></p>
        <h2 id="lead-title" style="margin: 0px; max-inline-size: 24ch; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: var(--weight-extrabold); font-size: var(--text-fluid-title); line-height: var(--leading-snug); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tighter); color: var(--text-strong); text-wrap: balance;"><span class="sc-interp">I lead the product, not only the pixels</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div data-cq=""><ul data-reveal-group="" data-cq-3="" style="display: grid; gap: var(--grid-gap);">
        
          <li style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-4); padding: var(--space-6); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); background: var(--surface-page); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);">
            <span aria-hidden="true" data-icon-tile="" style="inline-size: 44px; block-size: 44px; flex-shrink: 0; display: grid; place-items: center; border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: var(--gradient-ink); color: var(--on-ink-strong);"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"></circle></svg></span>
            <h3 style="margin: 0px; font-size: var(--text-h3); font-weight: var(--weight-bold); line-height: var(--leading-heading); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tight); color: var(--text-strong); text-wrap: balance;"><span class="sc-interp">Product ownership</span></h3>
            <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: var(--text-body-md); line-height: var(--leading-relaxed); color: var(--text-body); text-wrap: pretty;"><span class="sc-interp">I turn business goals into a roadmap, pick the metric that matters, then prototype to learn before we build.</span></p>
            <ul style="display: grid; gap: var(--space-2);">
              <li style="display: flex; gap: var(--space-2); align-items: baseline; font-size: var(--text-body-sm); line-height: var(--leading-normal); color: var(--text-strong);"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--text-success)" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="flex-shrink: 0; transform: translateY(3px);"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span><span class="sc-interp">Roadmaps co-owned with leadership</span></span></li><li style="display: flex; gap: var(--space-2); align-items: baseline; font-size: var(--text-body-sm); line-height: var(--leading-normal); color: var(--text-strong);"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--text-success)" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="flex-shrink: 0; transform: translateY(3px);"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span><span class="sc-interp">One North Star metric per feature</span></span></li><li style="display: flex; gap: var(--space-2); align-items: baseline; font-size: var(--text-body-sm); line-height: var(--leading-normal); color: var(--text-strong);"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--text-success)" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="flex-shrink: 0; transform: translateY(3px);"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span><span class="sc-interp">Journey maps and service blueprints</span></span></li>
            </ul>
            <a data-link="" href="/case-studies/colaberry-design-system" style="margin-block-start: auto; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-1); inline-size: fit-content; min-block-size: var(--tap-target); font-size: var(--text-body-sm); font-weight: var(--weight-semibold); text-decoration: none; color: var(--text-link);"><span><span class="sc-interp">Read the design system case</span></span><svg data-dir-icon="" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="flex-shrink: 0;"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a>
          </li>
        
          <li style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-4); padding: var(--space-6); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); background: var(--surface-page); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);">
            <span aria-hidden="true" data-icon-tile="" style="inline-size: 44px; block-size: 44px; flex-shrink: 0; display: grid; place-items: center; border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: var(--gradient-ink); color: var(--on-ink-strong);"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle></svg></span>
            <h3 style="margin: 0px; font-size: var(--text-h3); font-weight: var(--weight-bold); line-height: var(--leading-heading); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tight); color: var(--text-strong); text-wrap: balance;"><span class="sc-interp">Team and delivery</span></h3>
            <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: var(--text-body-md); line-height: var(--leading-relaxed); color: var(--text-body); text-wrap: pretty;"><span class="sc-interp">I mentor designers, run hiring and keep multi-quarter work moving across Product, Engineering, Marketing, Sales and AI Research.</span></p>
            <ul style="display: grid; gap: var(--space-2);">
              <li style="display: flex; gap: var(--space-2); align-items: baseline; font-size: var(--text-body-sm); line-height: var(--leading-normal); color: var(--text-strong);"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--text-success)" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="flex-shrink: 0; transform: translateY(3px);"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span><span class="sc-interp">Mentor the UX team</span></span></li><li style="display: flex; gap: var(--space-2); align-items: baseline; font-size: var(--text-body-sm); line-height: var(--leading-normal); color: var(--text-strong);"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--text-success)" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="flex-shrink: 0; transform: translateY(3px);"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span><span class="sc-interp">Led hiring for the creative team</span></span></li><li style="display: flex; gap: var(--space-2); align-items: baseline; font-size: var(--text-body-sm); line-height: var(--leading-normal); color: var(--text-strong);"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--text-success)" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="flex-shrink: 0; transform: translateY(3px);"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span><span class="sc-interp">Handoffs engineers and coding agents build from</span></span></li>
            </ul>
            <a data-link="" href="/about" style="margin-block-start: auto; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-1); inline-size: fit-content; min-block-size: var(--tap-target); font-size: var(--text-body-sm); font-weight: var(--weight-semibold); text-decoration: none; color: var(--text-link);"><span><span class="sc-interp">More about me</span></span><svg data-dir-icon="" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="flex-shrink: 0;"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a>
          </li>
        
          <li style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-4); padding: var(--space-6); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); background: var(--surface-page); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);">
            <span aria-hidden="true" data-icon-tile="" style="inline-size: 44px; block-size: 44px; flex-shrink: 0; display: grid; place-items: center; border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: var(--gradient-ink); color: var(--on-ink-strong);"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m3 11 18-5v12L3 14v-3z"></path><path d="M11.6 16.8a3 3 0 1 1-5.8-1.6"></path></svg></span>
            <h3 style="margin: 0px; font-size: var(--text-h3); font-weight: var(--weight-bold); line-height: var(--leading-heading); letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tight); color: var(--text-strong); text-wrap: balance;"><span class="sc-interp">Content systems for KSA and UAE</span></h3>
            <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: var(--text-body-md); line-height: var(--leading-relaxed); color: var(--text-body); text-wrap: pretty;"><span class="sc-interp">In marketing I work as analyst and designer: I find the gap, then build the workflow that fills it, in English and Arabic.</span></p>
            <ul style="display: grid; gap: var(--space-2);">
              <li style="display: flex; gap: var(--space-2); align-items: baseline; font-size: var(--text-body-sm); line-height: var(--leading-normal); color: var(--text-strong);"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--text-success)" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="flex-shrink: 0; transform: translateY(3px);"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span><span class="sc-interp">Prompt-to-video ad pipelines</span></span></li><li style="display: flex; gap: var(--space-2); align-items: baseline; font-size: var(--text-body-sm); line-height: var(--leading-normal); color: var(--text-strong);"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--text-success)" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="flex-shrink: 0; transform: translateY(3px);"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span><span class="sc-interp">Sales decks, one-pagers and event kits</span></span></li><li style="display: flex; gap: var(--space-2); align-items: baseline; font-size: var(--text-body-sm); line-height: var(--leading-normal); color: var(--text-strong);"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--text-success)" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="flex-shrink: 0; transform: translateY(3px);"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span><span class="sc-interp">Bilingual, RTL-ready templates</span></span></li>
            </ul>
            <a data-link="" href="/read" style="margin-block-start: auto; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-1); inline-size: fit-content; min-block-size: var(--tap-target); font-size: var(--text-body-sm); font-weight: var(--weight-semibold); text-decoration: none; color: var(--text-link);"><span><span class="sc-interp">See content and reels</span></span><svg data-dir-icon="" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="flex-shrink: 0;"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a>
          </li>
        
      </ul></div>
    </div>
  </section>
